# Application MediatR

- Multiple features: `Commands/<Feature>/`, `Queries/<Feature>/`.
- One public type per file; command `record` and handler in separate files when either is more than a few lines.
- `AddApplication()` registers scoped mapper + MediatR from the Application assembly.

```csharp
public static IServiceCollection AddApplication(this IServiceCollection services)
{
    services.AddScoped<IMapper, Mapper>();
    services.AddMediatR(x => x.RegisterServicesFromAssembly(typeof(ApplicationSetting).Assembly));
    return services;
}
```
